t#gid=0</a></p><p><em>Plano de MKT</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/11ISY3U2FlHU35d3Ddi3scz-nu-e1cKmoak_tY3jb2DQ/edit#gid=896631117" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/11ISY3U2FlHU35d3Ddi3scz-nu-e1cKmoak_tY3jb2DQ/edit#gid=896631117</a></p><p><em>Gastos com anúncio Juff Sportswear e Juff Store</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tY4jHFeYNxnhjVFJPjNI28JkTdooIEO5jG3cpR3WtOg/edit#gid=1017292316" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tY4jHFeYNxnhjVFJPjNI28JkTdooIEO5jG3cpR3WtOg/edit#gid=1017292316</a></p><p><em>Posicionamento Juff Store ( DOC que não uso mais - é antigo)</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1a4wlsEdh1oy2k1h-eZeSBFrj0rSqyJoxw1cQwTFjYmc/edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1a4wlsEdh1oy2k1h-eZeSBFrj0rSqyJoxw1cQwTFjYmc/edit</a></p><p><em>Slides de Posicionamento Juff Store - Oficial</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1dXZWi5ZOj1E9OGlAQEVPEyv7YDQOHQZ_0vFYHUpkEew/edit#slide=id.g26631e3e248_0_171" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1dXZWi5ZOj1E9OGlAQEVPEyv7YDQOHQZ_0vFYHUpkEew/edit#slide=id.g26631e3e248_0_171</a></p><p><em>Textos e descrições para produtos Juff Store</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VBnSOWG-x9_Kgod4ZvvFyu1-Zfhr5yYGa3NO0cxhWWU/edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VBnSOWG-x9_Kgod4ZvvFyu1-Zfhr5yYGa3NO0cxhWWU/edit</a></p><p><em>Regulamento JUFF</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HVJGBYkqXu_AWwgC2PjVvY814al19XIE/edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HVJGBYkqXu_AWwgC2PjVvY814al19XIE/edit</a></p><p><em>Textos para Disclaimer</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mCUVX3qgmZ2tYWpoxGPdDFfjR6gOZF0oHvHTPAPl0FA/edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mCUVX3qgmZ2tYWpoxGPdDFfjR6gOZF0oHvHTPAPl0FA/edit</a></p><p><em>Prompts para Juff Store</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uHIjnZAyreRk7NEMVe65uWE2cgC9BvLFzz8Q2b8aaVw/edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uHIjnZAyreRk7NEMVe65uWE2cgC9BvLFzz8Q2b8aaVw/edit</a></p><p><em>Papel Timbrado Juff</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1SHQ725jpqH85Dsu9j9Mj7TnzHKG1sHz3PmdVdz-2gBA/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1SHQ725jpqH85Dsu9j9Mj7TnzHKG1sHz3PmdVdz-2gBA/edit?usp=sharing</a></p><p><em>Textos Juff Store - Páginas Internas</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HpSaYRVs9rzvUKWfTmtmJpZlIxIMmTVp5rkbUP3fyOc/edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HpSaYRVs9rzvUKWfTmtmJpZlIxIMmTVp5rkbUP3fyOc/edit</a></p><p><em>Tutorial de Uso da Plataforma de Pedidos</em></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/18i9hKY6sQmqzgZHIHyLqobd_FBKioBBAVu1wNtUsJjw/edit#heading=h.6xoeoxindn4h" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://docs.google.com/document/d/18i9hKY6sQmqzgZHIHyLqobd_FBKioBBAVu1wNtUsJjw/edit#heading=h.6xoeoxindn4h</a></p>$juff$,
       coalesce((select max(x.posicao) + 1 from public.tarefa_cards x where x.coluna_id = c.id), 0),
       p.id, p.id
from public.tarefa_quadros q
join public.tarefa_colunas c on c.quadro_id = q.id and c.nome = 'Planejamento' and c.arquivado = false
join public.profiles p on p.email = 'marketing@juff.com.br'
where q.nome = 'Juff Store' and q.arquivado = false
  and not exists (
    select 1 from public.tarefa_cards y
    where y.quadro_id = q.id and y.titulo = 'IDEIAS PARA JUFF STORE + LINKS IMPORTANTES'
  );

alter table public.tarefa_cards enable trigger notificar_atribuicao;